Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 06:22:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enablement of Eth WAN SLAAC

[Description] : Here we are adding the code to check for the IPv6 address on the eth1 wan interface which is added by kernel based on the accept_ra proc entry and then processing this IPv6 info to get the prefix and create an IPv6 address for the brlan0, then setting the sysevents needed for Zebra to be populated so zebra.conf can be populated properly.

Signed-off-by: Sanketh Gopal <sankgopa@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 .../TR-181/board_sbapi/cosa_dhcpv6_apis.c     |   8 +
 .../TR-181/board_sbapi/cosa_dhcpv6_apis_ext.c | 179 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 187 insertions(+)

